  "label": "The slogan 'my body my choice' is mapped onto the visual act of erasing 'Abortion'.",
  "description": "The text 'my body my choice' is overlaid on the image of a hand erasing the word 'Abortion'. This creates an analogical mapping where the slogan, which represents the pro-choice principle of bodily autonomy, is visually contrasted with the act of erasure, symbolizing the rejection or removal of abortion as a choice. The mapping implies that the slogan is being used to frame the erasure as a positive or justified action, thereby associating the pro-choice message with the visual metaphor of removal.",
